{"ID":"20240522082303-3z8f9vn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082303-3z8f9vn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082303-3z8f9vn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085134-hslq1ll\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085137-wowcua8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085134-c8c2rwq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:159,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:165\u0026#125;","title":"長期的失眠與頭痛","type":"doc","updated":"20240522085301"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-hslq1ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-hslq1ll","updated":"20240522085208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"長期失眠、頭痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-3h0v7dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-3h0v7dh","updated":"20240522085209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"◎基本資料："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-1jeiprt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-1jeiprt","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王女士、年齡：49、身高：145 公分、體重：46公斤、腰圍：28 英吋、職業別：家管"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-le47igc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-le47igc","updated":"20240522085206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"◎初診：2007.11.18"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-95iombd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-95iombd","updated":"20240522085218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當天晚上下班後，小弟去理髮店理髮，聽見理髮阿姨的親戚王女士在旁邊苦惱地說目前正在吃抗憂鬱的藥….。自從學了人紀之後，其他人只要提到「病」總是特別敏感，心想不妙，再吃抗憂鬱藥，將如倪師所說，改天會很快地去自殺"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（5年前，坐在隔壁的同事也是：失眠→吃安眠藥→憂鬱→吃抗憂鬱藥→自殺，讓我心痛不已）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以理完髮後，很和氣地跟他說，我略懂中醫，可以幫他處理看看，給我兩個星期時間，假設沒任何改善，就當成什麼事都沒發生，畢竟不收取他任何費用，患者也欣然接受。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-ksrcyky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ksrcyky","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者訴說其病史，長期失眠已經兩、三年，每天晚上11點上床，放輕音樂及點芳香精油，仍舊很難入睡，都要到半夜2、3點才能入睡，且每天僅能睡2~3小時。前前後後看了很多中、西醫師，也吃了安眠藥一段時間，還是睡不著，西醫說他有點憂鬱，便開給他抗憂鬱的藥，吃了一段時間，仍是無效。曾經花了很多錢，購買很貴的「安眠枕頭」，依然無效。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-pcz4ucs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-pcz4ucs","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診 :"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-29h60ol","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-29h60ol","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-n1r8ewy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-n1r8ewy","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-cn7cflj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-cn7cflj","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問睡眠如何： 長期失眠已二三年, 每天需到半夜二三點方能入睡"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-70dveyq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-70dveyq","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-kigoowv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-kigoowv","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問體力：疲憊中"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-v5kdksk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-v5kdksk","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-qr734tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-qr734tz","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問汗出：不易出汗"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-cpknneq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-cpknneq","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-rfnjp0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-rfnjp0r","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問胃口：胃口還好"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-de83l5r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-de83l5r","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-ziglpth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ziglpth","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問大便：每天有大便，無便秘，大便臭。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-ljj83gt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ljj83gt","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-7w0im41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-7w0im41","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問小便：淡白，5-6次"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-0po79pm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-0po79pm","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-d37dqv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-d37dqv1","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問寒熱：手腳溫熱、身熱。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-vbtedwk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-vbtedwk","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-7wgty4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-7wgty4n","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問口渴：不渴，想喝冰水。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-qglnvkd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-qglnvkd","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-e0uapn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-e0uapn7","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女子月經：44歲停經，沒有生小孩。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-t710hm2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MTAu","Num":10},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-t710hm2","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-qzgfz96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-qzgfz96","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔淡白。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-erm4fh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-erm4fh0","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-mj0zzcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-mj0zzcz","updated":"20240522085224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黃連阿膠湯加減"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-6zr5203","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-6zr5203","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黃連、黃芩、生白芍、百合、遠志、柏子仁、鬱金、酸棗仁、阿膠。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-eam6ja7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-eam6ja7","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-ah3e0so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ah3e0so","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上生藥，以水六碗，煮成 二 碗。早、晚，空腹溫服 一 碗，溫服時加入阿膠烊沖，並加入生蛋黃一枚，與之調和再服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-3qgylwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-3qgylwq","updated":"20240522085201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"◎2007.12.4 電話追蹤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-zc31fpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-zc31fpz","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者自述吃了五帖後，因前陣子人感冒，跑去看西醫後，便停止服用中藥"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-obuw059","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-obuw059","updated":"20240522085226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(電話告誡，感冒還是看中醫，不要看西醫)。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-t7e1z2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-t7e1z2v","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然而停藥兩個禮拜期間，失眠已改善85 %，患者希望我可以幫他改善長年頭痛問題，大部分都是痛在後腦杓部位。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-132nwu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-132nwu4","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-zgo5qkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-zgo5qkt","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針對其頭痛部分，在原方中加入「川芎、羌活、防風、白芷、殭蠶」。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-az1ofxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-az1ofxw","updated":"20240522085159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"◎2008.01.24電話追蹤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-ky7uil5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ky7uil5","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者自述服藥7帖，前三帖中加入（川芎、羌活、防風、白芷、殭蠶），服藥期間，頭痛程度變兩倍，停藥後，頭痛狀況改善50%，失眠改善至90%。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-1ym61fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-1ym61fw","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-3ceetri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-3ceetri","updated":"20240522085232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方更改如下"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(黃連阿膠湯+加味逍遙散加減+去風要藥)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：先服五帖，再回報。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-ullk8nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-ullk8nl","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黃連、黃芩、生白芍、百合、遠志、柏子仁、鬱金、酸棗仁、柴胡、當歸、牡丹皮、山梔子、白朮、茯苓、川芎、羌活、防風、白芷、殭蠶、炙草、阿膠。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-4e1h4wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-4e1h4wk","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-tsgr1wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-tsgr1wr","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上生藥，以水9 碗，煮成 3 碗。早、晚，空腹溫服 一 碗，溫服時加入阿膠烊沖，並加入生蛋黃一枚，與之調和再服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-sxoei9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-sxoei9n","updated":"20240522085155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"◎2008.02.02農曆過年前"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-cud4a5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-cud4a5m","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去理髮店理髮，看見患者笑瞇瞇的說其失眠及長年頭痛已經痊癒，並拿了兩瓶玉泉紅酒禮盒來送我。跟他推辭說，我不可以收禮，就在那邊推來推去，最後我還是輸了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-tl17zw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-tl17zw1","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"後記："}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-85ek379","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-85ek379","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-8hp5t7w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-8hp5t7w","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-70f6ed4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-70f6ed4","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理髮阿姨的外孫女(三歲)，瘦小，幾乎每2～3個星期便感冒一次，胃口不好，經常去看西醫。小女孩的媽媽求助於我，我就一邊理髮一邊跟他們上「中醫的健康教育」，並說以後感冒還是看中醫吧。建議他們每天給小女孩吃「科學中藥的小建中湯」。神奇的事發生了，五個月來，竟然都沒感冒，胃口變得很好，會主動要食物吃。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-7a12c9e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-7a12c9e","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-23m6iik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-23m6iik","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小女孩的媽媽，本身有很嚴重的「蕁麻疹」，每天上午上半身、手臂會起很大的紅疹，一條一條的，很癢，看西醫皮膚科也都沒改善，已經有六七年的病史了。詢問其住家是否潮濕，果真相當潮濕，囑其用除濕機改善家中環境，並保持通風良好。方子使用老師教的「麻黃 + XX湯」，光用科學中藥粉，不到一個月時間，竟然將他的惡疾治癒。過程中，每個星期以電話追蹤，患者真如倪師所說，會流出「油油」的汗耶！只能說，老師真的是太強了！"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-fnacpzl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-fnacpzl","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085134-4mqfjli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-4mqfjli","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現在他們一家都是「中醫」的支持者！"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-rrm7eyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-rrm7eyh","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"弟子 林去病 敬書 2008.07.24"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-pezp2bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-pezp2bl","updated":"20240522085142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-c8c2rwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-c8c2rwq","updated":"20240522085301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林同學是人纪班外圍購買DVD研習中醫的學員之一，現任台南某之名電子廠的電子工程師多年，已經事業有成，但是他並不滿足於現狀，他本身就對中醫懷有一份熱誠，現在自研究過人纪後，對中醫學更是充滿信心，他即將於明年進入中醫學院就讀，將來的成就必然超凡，現在已經有許多科技新貴加入我們經方家的行列，以全力支持正統中醫學為己任，我的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"千手千眼系統"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已經形成，未來我們的眼睛將看盡天下所有各個角落，我們的手將觸及所有需要幫助的人，這個系統將超越世上現有的任何慈善機構，我們以使用與宣傳正統經方為大願，願所有普羅大眾都能夠脫離病痛的苦海，大家都能過著健康無懼的一生，錯誤的西醫理論必須消滅，我中華文化的智慧才是真正可以解決病痛的醫學。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-uo0d1v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-uo0d1v3","updated":"20240522085146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我的地紀之旅，每次我在遇到各地廟宇中的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"普賢菩薩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"時，我都向祂參拜，在心中默禱的告訴祂，我必須要將此佛教醫學宏揚於世，否則世人將受盡西藥廠魔手的迫害，願菩薩的大願得以實行，我願足矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085134-5xhkjee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085134-5xhkjee","updated":"20240522085134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫  倪海厦謹記07/25/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522085136-wezppch","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522085136-wezppch"}},{"ID":"20240522085137-wowcua8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085137-wowcua8"}}]}